            "host-comparison-final4-extended": "Final4 opposite-order baseline-first2warmups+31recorded pairs; exact copied current binaries/source, no rebuild/relink/code change/exclusions/pooling. All66 records pass guards. Source wall+2.828%/totalCPU+2% (paired+3.291%/+4.348%); first7+10.385%/+6% remains separately. Source userCPU+9.375% and paint kernelCPU+15.385% remain explicit, not blanket green.",
        }[name],
